---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Senior Software Engineer"
  description="Muhammad Atif — Senior Software Engineer with 18+ years of experience across .NET, Microsoft 365, SharePoint, Power Platform, and AI."
>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32 lg:py-40">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <p class="mb-6 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-400">
          Senior Software Engineer
        </p>

        <h1
  class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl"
>
  Senior Software Engineer building
  <span class="text-sky-400">enterprise platforms</span>,
  modern .NET systems, and AI solutions.
</h1>

<p
  class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300 sm:text-xl"
>
  18+ years of experience designing and delivering enterprise software,
  Microsoft 365 and SharePoint platforms, Power Platform solutions, modern
  .NET applications, and AI-powered systems across GCC organizations.
</p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="/projects"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-sky-400"
          >
            View Projects
          </a>

          <a
            href="/ai-lab"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-900"
          >
            Explore AI Lab
          </a>

          <a
            href="/resume"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-300 transition hover:text-white"
          >
            View Resume →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

    <section class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4">
        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">18+</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Years of experience</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">7TB+</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Enterprise data migrated</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">15+</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Apps & workflows</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">GCC</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-400">Enterprise delivery experience</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-400">
          Engineering Capabilities
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
          From enterprise platforms to intelligent applications.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
          A combination of hands-on engineering, platform modernization,
          solution architecture, automation, and emerging AI capabilities.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-7"
        >
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-sky-400">01</p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">
            Enterprise Engineering
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Designing and developing scalable enterprise applications,
            backend services, integrations, and business solutions using
            .NET, C#, SQL Server, REST APIs, and modern engineering practices.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="skill-tag">C#</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">.NET</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">ASP.NET Core</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">REST APIs</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">SQL Server</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Microservices</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-7"
        >
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-sky-400">02</p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">
            Microsoft 365 & Cloud
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Building and modernizing Microsoft 365 solutions across
            SharePoint, Power Platform, SPFx, Microsoft Graph, Azure, and
            enterprise collaboration environments.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="skill-tag">SharePoint</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">SPFx</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">React</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Power Apps</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Power Automate</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Azure</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-7"
        >
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-sky-400">03</p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">
            AI & Intelligent Automation
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Exploring and building AI-powered solutions using LLMs,
            retrieval-augmented generation, intelligent knowledge systems,
            prompt engineering, and automation.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="skill-tag">LLM Applications</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">RAG</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Prompt Engineering</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Vector Search</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">AI Automation</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-7"
        >
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-sky-400">04</p>

          <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-white">
            Architecture & Leadership
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Leading complex modernization initiatives, migrations,
            architecture decisions, technical delivery, disaster recovery,
            security, and engineering teams.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="skill-tag">Solution Architecture</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Migration</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">DR</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Security</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Technical Leadership</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400">
            Selected Enterprise Work
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl">
            Enterprise platforms, modernization, and AI engineering
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
            Selected engineering engagements spanning large-scale migrations,
  Microsoft 365 modernization, business process automation, and
  AI-powered knowledge systems.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/projects"
          class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-slate-300 transition hover:text-white"
        >
          View all projects →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-7 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-slate-700 hover:shadow-md"
        >
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400">
            Enterprise Migration
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-white">
            7TB+ SharePoint Migration & Platform Modernization
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Large-scale enterprise migration from SharePoint 2019 to
            SharePoint Subscription Edition with a focus on data integrity and
            operational continuity.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-6">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">7TB+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Data migrated</div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">99.9%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Data integrity</div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">0</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Downtime</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/projects/oia-sharepoint-migration/"
            class="mt-7 inline-flex font-semibold text-sky-400 transition hover:text-sky-300"
          >
            View case study →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-7 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-slate-700 hover:shadow-md"
        >
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400">
            Microsoft 365 Modernization
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-white">
            SharePoint & Microsoft 365 Modernization
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            Modernization of enterprise SharePoint solutions using SharePoint
            Online, SPFx, React, Power Apps, and Power Automate.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-6">
            <div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">15+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Apps & workflows</div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">30%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Adoption increase</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/projects/bank-dhofar-modernization/"
            class="mt-7 inline-flex font-semibold text-sky-400 transition hover:text-sky-300"
          >
            View case study →
          </a>
        </article>

        <article
          class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-7 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-slate-700 hover:shadow-md"
        >
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400">
            AI Engineering
          </p>

          <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-white">
            Enterprise Knowledge Assistant
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">
            AI-powered knowledge assistant combining RAG, LLMs, vector search,
            semantic retrieval, and prompt engineering.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="skill-tag">RAG</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">LLMs</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Vector Search</span>
            <span class="skill-tag">Python</span>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/ai-lab/"
            class="mt-7 inline-flex font-semibold text-sky-400 transition hover:text-sky-300"
          >
            Explore AI Lab →
          </a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
    <section class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 text-center sm:py-24">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-400">
        Let's Connect
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
        Exploring senior engineering opportunities
      </h2>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">
        Interested in enterprise software engineering, Microsoft 365,
        SharePoint, Power Platform, AI engineering, or solution architecture?
        Let's discuss how I can contribute.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-sky-400"
        >
          Get in Touch
        </a>

        <a
          href="/resume/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-900"
        >
          View Resume
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>